  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward if sentiment is neutral or negative (especially after recent spikes).",
    "Reduce forecast overshoots following sharp price increases by applying a 10-15% dampening factor.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias: if forecast deviates >5% from recent 7-day average, adjust toward it.",
    "Avoid over-optimism in early forecast windows (1-3 days) — reduce initial forecast by 2-3% for high sentiment.",
    "If sentiment history shows sustained positive momentum, slightly increase forecast lag (delayed response by 1-2 days)."
  ]
}
